            </note>
            <note corresp="#d757-f3" n="68" xml:id="d757-f3-content">
                <p>The Chinese Foreign Office on Nov. 28 released part 4 of the report and Dr.
                    Wang’s declaration, for publication on Nov. 29.</p>
            </note>
